sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 고객
    participant V as Vue
    participant C as RfqController
    participant RS as RfqService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant P as AnalysisProducer
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant CO as AnalysisConsumer
    participant AG as Agent 서버

    고객->>V: RFQ 파일 업로드 (rfqNumber)
    V->>C: POST /api/rfqs (multipart, JWT)
    C->>RS: receive(file, rfqNumber, user)
    RS->>RS: 권한 확인 (CUSTOMER) · 파일 저장
    RS->>DB: TX: rfqs(RECEIVED) + ai_tasks(QUEUED) 저장
    DB-->>RS: 커밋
    RS->>P: 커밋 후 발행
    P->>MQ: analysis.requested (persistent · confirm · mandatory)
    RS-->>C: taskId
    C-->>V: 202 {rfqId, rfqNumber, taskId}
    V->>C: GET /api/ai/tasks/{taskId}/stream (SSE 연결)
    MQ->>CO: 메시지 전달 (Unacked)
    CO->>DB: messageId 중복 확인 (processed_messages)
    CO->>DB: UPDATE ai_tasks SET RUNNING WHERE status = QUEUED
    CO->>DB: UPDATE rfqs SET IN_REVIEW
    CO->>AG: POST /runs {taskId, threadId, rfqNumber}
    AG-->>CO: 202 접수
    CO->>MQ: ack
    Note over CO,AG: 실패 시 3회 재시도, 소진되면 DLQ로 격리
